WEBVTT

1
00:00:08,660 --> 00:00:10,900
Two thousand catties of rice, three thousand catties of cornmeal

2
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:12,900
Five thousand pounds of sweet potatoes, potatoes and pumpkins

3
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:15,540
Let the machinery factory pay back this batch first.

4
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:24,240
Brother Gao, the goods are at the back. Thanks.

5
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:32,670
Be careful during the process of thanking the car and putting it into storage.

6
00:00:32,670 --> 00:00:36,670
This is our factory’s life-saving food

7
00:00:36,670 --> 00:00:41,130
There is really food

8
00:00:41,130 --> 00:00:47,920
I heard it was all brought back by Qin Buying.

9
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:49,240
It’s really ten thousand kilograms

10
00:00:49,240 --> 00:00:51,620
The canteen can finally relax for a while.

11
00:00:51,620 --> 00:00:59,960
Hello, Comrade Qin Tian
